  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Education Outcomes Fund - Sierra Leone Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1) Supporting 117,000 students of 285 schools in Sierra-Leon through evidence-based education fund 2) Improve learning outcomes (literacy and numeracy) and achievement of minimum thresholds in a representative sample of primary schools, particularly for girls (with girls outcomes being paid at a 20% premium of that of boys) Inform which interventions and financing approaches are most effective to improve learning outcomes in education during and outside COVID-19, to help build evidence for future policymaking.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting 117,000 students of 285 schools in Sierra-Leon through evidence-based education fund mobilized by public and private sectors&#xc2dc;&#xc5d0;&#xb77c;&#xb9ac;&#xc628; 285&#xac1c; &#xd559;&#xad50; &#xb300;&#xc0c1; 117,000&#xba85; &#xd559;&#xc0dd;&#xc5d0;&#xac8c; &#xc2dc;&#xc758;&#xc801;&#xc808;&#xd55c; &#xad50;&#xc721;&#xc744; &#xc81c;&#xacf5;&#xd558;&#xace0; &#xad50;&#xc721; &#xc131;&#xacfc; &#xae30;&#xbc18; &#xc790;&#xae08; &#xc9d1;&#xd589;&#xc744; &#xd1b5;&#xd574; &#xad50;&#xc721; &#xc5ed;&#xb7c9; &#xbc0f; &#xd6a8;&#xacfc;&#xc131; &#xc99d;&#xb300;</narrative>
